pp:54，代码：std::string inputLayoutOriKeyPtr = std::string(inputLayoutOriKeyPtr)；attention/sparse_flash_mla/op_host/sparse_flash_mla_proto.cpp:84，代码：ge::graphStatus InferDataTypeSparseFlashAttention(gert::InferDataTypeContext *context)；attention/sparse_flash_mla/op_host/sparse_flash_mla_proto.cpp:93，代码：InferDataType(InferDataTypeSparseFlashMla)\n问题：本次改动在同一作用域内用 inputLayoutOriKeyPtr 同时声明 const char * 和 std::string，形成同名变量重定义；同时把数据类型推导函数定义改名为 InferDataTypeSparseFlashAttention，但注册处仍引用 InferDataTypeSparseFlashMla。期望语义是先保存 layout_kv 字符串并把同一个 InferDataType 函数注册到 SparseFlashMla，当前实际代码无法通过 C++ 编译。\n可能导致的结果：编译 sparse_flash_mla op_host 时会触发变量重定义和未声明函数错误，导致 SparseFlashMla 算子注册失败，依赖该算子的构建或集成流程无法继续。\n建议的修改方法：将 std::string 变量改为不同名称，例如 inputLayoutOriKey，并统一数据类型推导函数的定义和注册名称；可以恢复为 InferDataTypeSparseFlashMla，或同步把 IMPL_OP 注册处改成新的函数名。","created_at":"2026-06-11T18:36:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-11T18:36:48+08:00","user":{"id":"687e1fcd0b80e6291e89dbf4","login":"Wei_NaChuan","object_id":"687e1fcd0b80e6291e89dbf4","name":"weinachuan","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Wei_NaChuan"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":175308236,"discussion_id":"168043eadbe642306cc120cd6960b794c9f1e291","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-06-11T19:12:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-11T19:12:02+08:00","user":{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","object_id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":175317676,"discussion_id":"0c83e72951d8192a7fce7768627be0322b1e4dac","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-06-11T19:52:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-11T19:52:56+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","object_id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]